      '<path d="m3 3 18 18M8.8 12.2a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 6.4 0M5.2 8.9a11 11 0 0 1 4.3-2.2M14.7 6.8a11 11 0 0 1 4.1 2.1M11.5 16.2a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1 0M12 20h.01"/>'
